  "Cell descriptor for layout/bin/compose-cell.py -- see layout/README.md for the recipe",
  "and layout/temp_por_top/README.md for the floorplan, routing, results and scope",
  "disclosures. Issue #240 (T1 item 2: block-level layout).",
  "",
  "Places the four committed leaf streams as opaque blocks[].cell siblings and wires",
  "the nets design/temp_por_top.sch connects between them. Ports are the leaves' own",
  "compose.response.json ports, hand-declared in each leaf's local frame; bias_core",
  "does not promote VREF, so its VREF port is derived from the in-stream label",
  "(ports_from_labels) rather than by changing the leaf.",
  "extract.hierarchical_cells + lvs.flatten_layout: see compose-cell.py's docstring",
  "(leaf-internal net labels collide across leaves in a flat extraction)."
